# Installation

See [README.md](README.md) for build and run instructions.

Quick start on the Coursera GPU environment:

```bash
make setup
pip install -r requirements.txt
make run
python3 scripts/package_proof_artifacts.py --root .
```

Windows users: see [WINDOWS.md](WINDOWS.md).

Repository: https://github.com/AyushGuha06/CudaCourse2026
